[statement]
An installed package gives way as a dependency as any other candidate
does (`conflicts/a-dependency-gives-way-to-a-choice-needing-it`): `top`
needs `e`, whose one candidate `e` 1 needs `a` and provides `w`, and `a`
3, installed, forbids `w`. apk downgrades `a` to 2.

[repository]
P:a
V:3
D:!w

P:a
V:2

P:e
V:1
D:a
p:w=1

P:top
V:1
D:e

[installed]
P:a
V:3
D:!w

[request]
top

[answer apk-tools 3.0.9-r0]
downgrade a 3 2
install e 1
install top 1
